Package: indi-scopelink
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: INDI driver for the Astrolabs ScopeLink telescope controller
 ScopeLink drives a focuser, a telescope front flap, a flat panel, two mirror
 fans and, depending on the hardware generation, two auxiliary power outputs
 and a powered USB hub, all over one USB connection.
 .
 The driver publishes the controller as a single INDI device carrying the
 focuser, dust cap and light box interfaces, so that any INDI client such as
 KStars can run autofocus, open and close the flap and take flat frames.
 .
 A simulation mode and a pseudo terminal simulator are included, so the driver
 can be tried without a controller attached.
